 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.76,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.148
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "追回的窗口，以小时计。",
   "spoken": "追回的窗口，以小时计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.58,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speechStart": 3.674,
   "speechEnd": 5.489
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "头几个小时里，被盗的钱，还是可冻结的稳定币，是交易所里的充值，或者是链上可以暂停的合约份额。",
   "spoken": "头几个小时里，被盗的钱，还是可冻结的稳定币，是交易所里的充值，或者是链上可以暂停的合约份额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 5.88,
   "dur": 8.72,
   "speechStart": 5.88,
   "speechEnd": 14.415
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "几个小时之后，它会变成跨链后的原生币，混币器里的存款，或者场外交易的现金。",
   "spoken": "几个小时之后，它会变成跨链后的原生币，混币器里的存款，或者场外交易的现金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 14.82,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 14.82,
   "speechEnd": 21.261
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "这里有两个动作。",
   "spoken": "这里有两个动作。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 21.68,
   "dur": 1.36,
   "speechStart": 21.68,
   "speechEnd": 22.83
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "资金追踪，是沿着链上交易，跟踪钱的去向。",
   "spoken": "资金追踪，是沿着链上交易，跟踪钱的去向。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 23.26,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 23.26,
   "speechEnd": 26.923
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "冻结，是由发行方、交易所或链上机制，阻止某个地址转出资产。",
   "spoken": "冻结，是由发行方、交易所或链上机制，阻止某个地址转出资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 27.4,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 27.497,
   "speechEnd": 33.732
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "打个比方，抢劫发生后，警方在城市的每个出口设卡。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，抢劫发生后，警方在城市的每个出口设卡。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 34.18,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 34.274,
   "speechEnd": 39.145
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "出口就是稳定币发行方、交易所、跨链桥和混币器。",
   "spoken": "出口就是稳定币发行方、交易所、跨链桥和混币器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 39.6,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 39.696,
   "speechEnd": 45.116
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "设卡越早，拦住的车越多。",
   "spoken": "设卡越早，拦住的车越多。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 45.58,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 45.676,
   "speechEnd": 48.224
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "劫匪一旦开上国道，换了车牌，再拦就很难了。",
   "spoken": "劫匪一旦开上国道，换了车牌，再拦就很难了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 48.68,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 48.68,
   "speechEnd": 52.521
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "spoken": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 52.98,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 53.073,
   "speechEnd": 54.574
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "链上的出口，大多不归任何警察管。",
   "spoken": "链上的出口，大多不归任何警察管。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 55.04,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 55.13,
   "speechEnd": 57.651
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "去中心化的跨链桥、混币器和交易所，没有义务配合。",
   "spoken": "去中心化的跨链桥、混币器和交易所，没有义务配合。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 58.06,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 58.154,
   "speechEnd": 62.984
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "能拦住的，主要是有中心化运营方的那部分出口。",
   "spoken": "能拦住的，主要是有中心化运营方的那部分出口。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 63.4,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 63.496,
   "speechEnd": 67.447
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "攻击者也清楚这一点，所以路线很固定。",
   "spoken": "攻击者也清楚这一点，所以路线很固定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 67.86,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 67.86,
   "speechEnd": 71.188
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "第一步，把稳定币换掉，躲开发行方冻结。",
   "spoken": "第一步，把稳定币换掉，躲开发行方冻结。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 71.6,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 71.702,
   "speechEnd": 75.421
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "第二步，分散到大量地址，抬高追踪成本。",
   "spoken": "第二步，分散到大量地址，抬高追踪成本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 75.82,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 75.82,
   "speechEnd": 79.365
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "第三步，跨链，或者进混币器，切断链上的关联。",
   "spoken": "第三步，跨链，或者进混币器，切断链上的关联。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 79.8,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 79.8,
   "speechEnd": 84.273
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "最后，通过场外交易，或者小额分批进交易所，换成现金。",
   "spoken": "最后，通过场外交易，或者小额分批进交易所，换成现金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-19.wav",
   "start": 84.66,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 84.753,
   "speechEnd": 89.673
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "实在走不掉，他就等，等关注度下降。",
   "spoken": "实在走不掉，他就等，等关注度下降。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-20.wav",
   "start": 90.08,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 90.08,
   "speechEnd": 93.549
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "2025 年 Bybit 被盗之后，约 72% 的资金经 THORChain 换成了 BTC，约 16% 经兑换服务 eXch 兑换。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 Bybit 被盗之后，约 72% 的资金经 THORChain 换成了 BTC，约 16% 经兑换服务 eXch 兑换。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-21.wav",
   "start": 93.98,
   "dur": 11.52,
   "speechStart": 94.078,
   "speechEnd": 105.287
  },
  {
